@BankApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5167
# To hit the deployed app instead, swap in the CloudFront URL:
# @BankApi_HostAddress = https://d168fzbhwdwvz0.cloudfront.net

# The admin password lives in user-secrets (Seed:AdminPassword), not in the
# repo. Paste it here locally to use the admin requests, but don't commit it:
#   dotnet user-secrets list --project BankApi | Select-String AdminPassword
@AdminPassword = paste-admin-password-here

### Log in as a customer (run this first; later requests reuse its token)
# @name customerLogin
POST {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jsmith",
  "password": "pass123"
}

### Log in as admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "{{AdminPassword}}"
}

### Wrong password -> 401
POST {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jsmith",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Register a new customer (no token needed)
POST {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tnewuser",
  "password": "hunter2"
}

### No token -> 401
GET {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/customer/jsmith


# --- As the customer -------------------------------------------------------

### My accounts
GET {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/customer/jsmith
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Someone else's accounts -> 403
GET {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/customer/agarcia
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Recent activity on one account
GET {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/CHK-1002/transactions?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Deposit
POST {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/CHK-1002/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 25
}

### Withdraw
POST {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/CHK-1002/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 25
}

### Transfer between my accounts
POST {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountNumber": "CHK-1002",
  "toAccountNumber": "SAV-1001",
  "amount": 10
}

### Open a new account
POST {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerUsername": "jsmith",
  "accountType": "Savings"
}


# --- As admin ----------------------------------------------------------------

### All customers
GET {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### All accounts with balance >= 500
GET {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts?minBalance=500
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### All transactions for one customer (filters: username, accountNumber, from, to, limit)
GET {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/transactions?username=jsmith&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Freeze an account (status: Active | Frozen | Closed; a reason is required)
POST {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/CHK-1002/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Frozen",
  "reason": "Suspicious activity reported"
}

### Unfreeze it
POST {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/CHK-1002/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Active",
  "reason": "Cleared after review"
}

### Disable a customer's login (status: Active | Disabled)
POST {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/agarcia/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Disabled",
  "reason": "Identity verification failed"
}

### Re-enable it
POST {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/agarcia/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Active",
  "reason": "Verified in branch"
}

### Audit log, newest first (optional targetId = account number or username)
GET {{BankApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/audit?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}
